    "body": "This is somewhat related to my concern above about running \"and its descendants\" algorithms on the main thread.) Can we add an assertion about what \"thread\" this algorithm (and the corresponding \"destroy\" algorithm) is running on? Ideally we could always run these ones on the SHT queue or somewhere else in parallel, but I'm not totally sure....",
