    "body": "Somehow, I meant to call the \"and descendants\" version recursively in all three of these, but failed to do so. Fixing.\r\n\r\nEdit: I guess \"abort a document and its descendants\" can use \"descendant navigables\" directly since it won't cause any event loop destruction, so everything can be done fully concurrently among all descendants.",
