    "body": "Which exact algorithm are you commenting on? It looks to me like you're commenting on \"abort a document and its descendants\", which has such an assert as its first line.\r\n\r\nIndeed, 5/6 algorithms (unload/destroy/abort x normal/and its descendants) have such asserts. I'll add the one remaining one (to \"destroy a document and its descendants\").",
